# Tenant Marketing Content Safety

Copy and media URLs live in JSON settings — Storage files only render when those URLs stay linked.

| Surface | Source of truth |
|---------|-----------------|
| Platform `/` + `/admin/homepage` | `platform_settings.marketing_homepage` |
| Brand public + `/app/homepage` | `brand_settings.settings.landing` |
| Franchise/center public | `brand_settings.settings.center_landing` (fallback brand `landing`) |
| Login / student portal chrome | `brands.logo_url`, portal branding RPC, `login_headline` / `login_subtext` |

Bucket: `brand-assets` (`platform/marketing/…`, `{brandId}/marketing/…`, logos, center/student photos).

## MUST

- Always **merge** stored partials into theme defaults — never return pure defaults when landing JSON or `brand-assets` URLs exist.
- Brand/center RPC fallbacks must still pass `row.landing` / logo when names are incomplete.
- Editor saves (`saveHomepageConfig`, `saveBrandMarketingLanding`) must run `preserveCustomMarketingMediaUrls` so Unsplash/stock cannot overwrite uploaded media.
- Seed / upserts of `brand_settings` must prefer existing settings (`EXCLUDED.settings || brand_settings.settings`) — never full-replace.
- Theme switch updates `brands.marketing_theme` only — do not clear landing JSON.
- Keep `regression_*` coverage for platform + brand/center media preservation.

## MUST NOT

- Discard config solely for Novu `bgGradient` / `themeNote` (platform legacy gate).
- Drop `landing` on brand/center fallback paths.
- `ON CONFLICT … DO UPDATE SET settings = EXCLUDED.settings` for `brand_settings`.
- Save an editor while the UI is showing stock defaults over customized DB content.
- Delete Storage objects to “fix” missing images — fix JSON URLs.
- Inherit brand `social_connect` Facebook/Instagram onto center public footers (use `franchise_centers.social_links`).

## Code / specs

- Guard helpers: `apps/web/src/lib/marketingMediaGuard.ts`
- Platform: `homepageApi.ts` + OpenSpec `marketing-homepage`
- Brand/center: `brandLandingApi.ts`, `centerLandingApi.ts`, `brandLandingEditorApi.ts`
- Docs: `docs/frontend/marketing-landing.md`, `docs/ops/runbook.md`
